an.md, compute[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]today_roots in Rust from today_tasks via the Pomodoro home resolver, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]print the ROOTS line, and add shared today_roots conformance vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins retires the type cap[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugins-drop-type-cap[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-drop-type-cap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins-drop-type-cap: mirror the cap removal across bob-ledger-tools, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]block-id-prompt, bob-navigation-hotkeys, and task-status-cycler (TODAY [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]L/Lc chip, caps API, routing, pickers, notices), copy the routing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vectors, update tests and docs, and sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The roots line in the bob-plan block[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugins-today-roots[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-today-roots, plugins-drop-type-cap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins-today-roots: add a pure planTodayRoots model, paint the ringed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]roots line after the ★ type line with click-to-open, styles, and repaint[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wiring, and run the shared today_roots vectors plus DOM tests, then [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sync.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-f9","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-f9.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-93e6e5eff48473c4f7c1092fd0626d1b","started_at":"2026-11-01T17:14:28.358055+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"09e12490a379fef786